      ],
      "source": "https://unitedstatesghosttowns.com/south-lincoln-vermont-ghost-town/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "South Lincoln sits in the valley of the New Haven River and is bordered by the Green Mountain National Forest.",
